{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06453","headline":"题少府监李丞山池 · 李颀","name":"题少府监李丞山池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"能向府亭内，置兹山与林。\n他人驌驦马，而我薜萝心。\n雨止禁门肃，莺啼官柳深。\n长廊閟军器，积水背城阴。\n窓外王孙草，牀头中散琴。\n清风多仰慕，吾亦尔知音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}